00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:44.000
Kanagawa School of Medical Science

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:44.000
Secondary Hospital

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:44.250
Excuse me.

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:47.380
Is Nurse Yabuuchi from
the Internal Medicine department available?

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:49.420
I'm her younger sister.

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:52.540
Uh, let's see. Does anyone know
where Ms. Yabuuchi is right now?

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:55.670
In room 305, doing her check up on Mrs. Kurumatani.

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:59.250
Oh, then I'll just head directly over
to that room, if that's okay.

00:17:59.460 --> 00:18:01.540
These flowers I brought are actually for that patient.

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:02.880
Oh, how nice.

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:04.810
Yuka Kurumatani

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:07.170
Good afternoon.

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:10.000
Oh my.

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:12.040
Madoka?!

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:14.960
Um, I'm... s-s-sorry....!

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:17.670
You should at least knock before you come in, jeez!

00:18:17.670 --> 00:18:19.340
It's all right, I don't mind.

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:20.630
I'm so sorry.

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:23.090
I've still got some nice curves on me, huh?

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:24.960
Mrs. Kurumatani!

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:29.670
Prairie gentian flowers, right? Such a wonderful aroma.

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:31.090
Thank you.

00:18:31.090 --> 00:18:32.420
Oh, it's nothing.

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:34.130
So why aren't you at school right now?

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:35.380
Don't tell me you're skipping class again!

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.670
We're out early because it's test week!

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:41.040
Oh wow, and you came all the way out here to visit me?

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:45.170
You should have come after test week was over, then!

00:18:45.170 --> 00:18:48.090
Don't make Mrs. Kurumatani feel bad
for interrupting your study time!

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:49.380
Please, it's okay.

00:18:50.420 --> 00:18:52.630
I had to... come and return this.

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:57.250
Hold on, isn't that the bracelet she asked you to...?

00:18:57.250 --> 00:18:59.540
You didn't go through with it, then?

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:00.500
I'm sorry.

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:02.290
I'm so relieved!

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:03.630
Huh?

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:07.880
That boy is bright enough to recognize who made it.

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:09.920
I think he would have figured it out right away.

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:12.250
So I regretted asking you to give it to him.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:13.630
Mrs. Kurumatani...

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:16.630
I'm so glad he didn't end up getting it!

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:18.710
Thank you so much, Madoka.

00:19:19.210 --> 00:19:20.460
Don't mention it.

00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:27.170
So, would you mind staying
to chat with me for a little while?

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:29.540
You came right when I was feeling a bit bored.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.000
Oh, sure! My pleasure.

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:39.490
Recommended Sunset

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:39.490
Tourist Spots

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:52.590
Wow! That was so much fun!

00:19:52.590 --> 00:19:54.590
She even gave me this tasty-looking apple.

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:57.540
Mrs. Yuka really is so charming.

00:19:57.540 --> 00:19:59.880
Oh please, have a little more respect.

00:20:00.290 --> 00:20:02.540
She was so considerate after you barged in like that.

00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:06.710
You should have followed through and come up
with some way to give Sora that bracelet, jeez.

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:09.590
What a nice aroma...

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:14.790
Hey, Sis?

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:15.630
Hm?

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:18.000
Did Mrs. Yuka... undergo surgery?

00:20:18.590 --> 00:20:19.380
What?

00:20:20.290 --> 00:20:23.090
I noticed earlier... that she had a scar on her chest.

00:20:24.210 --> 00:20:26.210
Oh, that's from not too long ago.

00:20:26.460 --> 00:20:28.130
You have some sharp eyes, Madoka.

00:20:28.670 --> 00:20:29.920
Is she all right now?

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:33.790
Well, it certainly wasn't a very difficult surgery.

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:35.710
They just cut her open and then sewed her back up.

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:38.170
What does that mean?

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:40.210
I've never heard of a surgery like that before.

00:20:41.210 --> 00:20:42.170
It's true.

00:20:44.920 --> 00:20:47.000
They went in and then stopped.

00:20:51.210 --> 00:20:54.250
Do you... understand what that means?

00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:05.840
Whoa, another one?!

00:21:06.420 --> 00:21:08.290
You're on fire, Tinytown!

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:10.590
You haven't missed a single shot all day!

00:21:10.710 --> 00:21:12.750
I haven't even had a chance to touch the ball, dammit!

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:14.340
Well, get used to it!

00:21:14.590 --> 00:21:16.540
This shrimp is truly something else.

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:22.540
I'm more impressed by how he gets open to shoot,
rather than his accuracy rate.

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:29.170
I can only imagine how many difficult trials he's overcome
with that small frame of his...

00:21:23.790 --> 00:21:24.590
One more time!

00:21:30.630 --> 00:21:34.590
My excitement is growing
with every day that we get closer to our first game.

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:40.340
We've assembled... some serious firepower!

00:21:57.170 --> 00:22:02.090
Hitori ja umaku ikanaku temo 
Even if things aren't going well on my own

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:06.290
Kikkake nante tanjun sa 
There's a simple way to turn it all around

00:22:08.210 --> 00:22:13.250
Mienai deguchi ni hikaru ga sashite 
A light falls down on an exit previously unseen

00:22:13.710 --> 00:22:17.420
Asu wa soko ni arunda 
That's where the path to tomorrow lies

00:22:18.040 --> 00:22:24.090
Hitori nanka ja nakatta 
I was never really alone to begin with

00:22:24.090 --> 00:22:29.290
Kono me ni utsuru keshiki no naka ni 
You were in the scenery reflected in my eyes

00:22:29.290 --> 00:22:35.670
Kimi ga ireba doko made datte ikeru sa 
I can go anywhere so long as you stay there

00:22:35.670 --> 00:22:40.540
Kitto genkai nante nainda 
There are no such things as limits

00:22:40.540 --> 00:22:45.710
Kimi to ireba tsuyoku narunda 
Just having you by my side makes me stronger

00:22:45.920 --> 00:22:52.790
Nando demo tachiagatte susunde ikou 
We'll pick ourselves up as often as needed and keep moving

00:22:52.920 --> 00:23:00.790
Oh oh oh, oh oh oh, oh oh oh,

00:23:00.790 --> 00:23:03.750
Saigo no ichibyou made 
Until the very last second

00:23:03.960 --> 00:23:06.590
Akiramenaide busukatte 
Don't give up and keep fighting

00:23:06.590 --> 00:23:13.670
Kono michi no saki wa kanarazu kagayaiteru kara 
A shining light is undoubtedly waiting for us down this path

00:23:17.960 --> 00:23:21.590
I went and bruised it... right after she gave it to me.

00:23:22.840 --> 00:23:26.130
I need to focus. I have tests tomorrow.

00:23:28.540 --> 00:23:29.920
I feel sick...

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:35.390
Ahiru no Sora

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:35.390
Next Time: Undiscovered Talent

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:34.500
Next time: "Undiscovered Talent."
